        "Live-action, 35mm film look, soft dawn light. A static wide shot inside the base of a stone lighthouse tower: a lone keeper in a heavy wool coat climbs the spiral iron staircase, one hand sliding along the cold wall, his boots ringing on each step. Halfway up he pauses at a narrow window, breathes out a plume of cold air, then keeps climbing. At the top he shoulders the hatch open, cold sea wind rushes in, and he steps onto the gallery as the lamp beam sweeps once across a grey sea and a low foghorn sounds far below."
